   "subject": "set priors for MCMC sampling",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">How does one set priors for MCMC sampling?<div><br></div><div>And if one doesn&#39;t what are the default values?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "uF73LjJVAwAJ",
   "from": "Kasper Kristensen",
   "author": "90b303eef43fd993",
   "date": "2016-10-10T07:49:24Z",
   "subject": "RE: [TMB users] set priors for MCMC sampling",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"black\" size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\" dir=\"ltr\">Priors will have to be set from the cpp template.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDefault is thus no prior (i.e. improper uniform distribution).<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></font>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tmb-...@googlegroups.com</a> [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tmb-...@googlegroups.com</a>] on behalf of Joseph Thorley [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@poissonconsulting.ca</a>]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Sunday, October 09, 2016 11:40 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> TMB Users<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [TMB users] set priors for MCMC sampling<br>\r\n</font><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:10pt\"><div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\"><div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">How does one set priors for MCMC sampling?\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>And if one doesn&#39;t what are the default values?</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thanks</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p></div></div></div></div>"
