   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Also note that if you want to put uniform priors on you will have to bound the parameter in the cpp template, with e.g., a logistic contrainst. You cannot (as of now) use bounds on the R side like you can with the optimizer. <div><br></div><div>I will be making some updates to the MCMC functions for TMB over the next months, so keep an eye out for those and please provide any feedback through the issue tracker.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Cole<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
